<title>USA: IMCO Recycling chairman Ingram CEO.</title>
<headline>IMCO Recycling chairman Ingram CEO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMCO Recycling Inc Friday said chairman Don Ingram has assumed the additional role of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Ingram succeeds Frank Romanelli, formerly president and chief executive, who resigned to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Richard Kerr, formerly president of the metals division, assumes the role of president, to go along with his duties as chief operating officer.</p>
